
### get places
GET http://localhost:3000/places?limit=100&page=1 HTTP/1.1

### update place
PATCH http://localhost:3000/places/pla_ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Une Meilleure description"
}

### limit overflow
GET http://localhost:3000/places?limit=102 HTTP/1.1

### invalid page
GET http://localhost:3000/places?page=0 HTTP/1.1

### invalid category
GET http://localhost:3000/places?category=NAN HTTP/1.1
